{{header pickups}}
'''Cards''' and '''runes''' are single-use pickups with a wide variety of effects. They take up the same [[item slot|slot]] as [[pill]]s.

[[#Runes|Runes]] and [[special card]]s are unlocked by completing [[challenge]]s.

In the base game, there are 32 cards and 8 runes.

* {{dlc+|a}} [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]] adds {{p|Get out of Jail Free Card}}, {{p|? Card}}, the {{p|Blank Rune}}, and two non-card consumables: {{p|Dice Shard}} and {{p|Emergency Contact}}.{{dlc-}}

* {{dlc+|a+}} [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]] adds the [[Ace cards]], {{p|Holy Card}}, and {{p|Black Rune}}, for a total of 39 cards and 10 runes.
** [[Booster Pack#1]] also added three other Magic: The Gathering cards: {{p|Huge Growth}}, {{p|Ancient Recall}}, and {{p|Era Walk}}.{{dlc-}}

* {{dlc+|r}} [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]] adds Reversed Major Arcana Cards, the {{p|Queen of Hearts}}, the {{p|Wild Card}}, {{p|Rune Shard}}s, Soul Stones, as well as the {{p|Cracked Key}}, for a grand total of 66 cards, 28 runes and 3 other consumables.{{dlc-}}

