== Trivia ==
* The appearance of the tarot cards seems to be based on the Universal Tarot of Marseille deck produced by Lo Scarabeo, most clearly seen with the card backs as well as the splash image that appears when using The Sun.
* The runes and their names ingame are based on the [[wikipedia:Elder Futhark|Elder Futhark]] alphabet system and its reconstructed [[wikipedia:Proto-Germanic language|Proto-Germanic]] names. In popular culture, runes often signify that something is in some way magical.
* Ancient Recall, Era Walk, Huge Growth, and Chaos Card are all based on cards from ''Magic: The Gathering''.
* A NULL card with ID 0 exists, revealed by the "giveitem k0" [[Debug Console]] command. It can't be acquired or used in any way.
* {{dlc|a+}} Many cards were given new unique back sprites in [[Booster Pack#5]], some originating from [https://antibirth.com/ Antibirth].
* {{dlc|r}} The Reverse Tarot Cards refer to tarot card readings, where a reversed card has a contrary meaning to its upright variant.

